      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, we could now have a test with a PD 3.0 partner where we change power state and check that the partner never received an alert or status message.\n\nAlthough, it\u0027s a bit tricky with the existing test fixture in usb_pd_rev3.c because we need to set the partner RMDO before connecting to it in the \"before\" function. So, if we want to start adding tests to compare TCPMv2 behavior with a PD 3.1 partner against TCPMv2 behavior with a PD 3.0 partner, I think we would need to set up another fixture or file for it.",
